@startuml
title US44 - Weather Person Remote Access Scenario

actor "Weather Person" as WeatherPerson
participant "RemoteAccessTcpClient" as Client
participant "RemoteAccessTcpServer" as TcpServer
control ":WeatherRemoteAccessController" as RemoteC
participant "credentialHandler\n:CredentialHandler" as Credentials
participant "authz\n:AisafeAuthorizationService" as Authz
participant "operations\n:ControllerWeatherRemoteOperations" as Ops
control ":RegisterWeatherDataController" as RegisterC
database "AISafe Persistence" as DB

WeatherPerson -> Client : Start client with service US44
Client -> TcpServer : SERVICE|US44
TcpServer -> RemoteC : new handler()
TcpServer --> Client : OK|Remote service selected: US44.

WeatherPerson -> Client : LOGIN|username|password
Client -> TcpServer : LOGIN|username|password
TcpServer -> RemoteC : handle(line)
RemoteC -> Credentials : authWithCredentialData(username, password)
Credentials --> RemoteC : true
RemoteC -> Authz : ensureAuthenticatedUserHasAnyOf(WEATHER_DATA_MANAGEMENT)
Authz --> RemoteC : authorized
RemoteC --> TcpServer : OK|Authenticated as username.
TcpServer --> Client : OK|Authenticated as username.

WeatherPerson -> Client : REGISTER_WEATHER_DATA|...
Client -> TcpServer : REGISTER_WEATHER_DATA|...
TcpServer -> RemoteC : handle(line)
RemoteC -> Authz : ensureAuthenticatedUserHasAnyOf(WEATHER_DATA_MANAGEMENT)
Authz --> RemoteC : authorized
RemoteC -> Ops : registerWeatherData(...)
Ops -> RegisterC : registerWeatherMeasurement(...)
RegisterC -> DB : save/update WeatherData
DB --> RegisterC : WeatherData
RegisterC --> Ops : WeatherData
Ops --> RemoteC : Weather data registered: ...
RemoteC --> TcpServer : OK|Weather data registered: ...
TcpServer --> Client : OK|Weather data registered: ...

WeatherPerson -> Client : LOGOUT
Client -> TcpServer : LOGOUT
TcpServer -> RemoteC : handle(LOGOUT)
RemoteC --> TcpServer : OK|Remote session closed.
TcpServer --> Client : OK|Remote session closed.

@enduml
